      },
      "text": "(ii) the functions of the Director of the Office of Management and Budget \nrelating to budgetary, administrative, or legislative proposals. \nVerDate Sep<11>2014 15:47 Dec 15, 2020 Jkt 253250 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\16DEE0.SGM 16DEE0khammond on DSKJM1Z7X2PROD with PRESDOC\n=== PDF page 2 of 2 ===\n81338 Federal Register / Vol. 85, No. 242 / Wednesday, December 16, 2020 / Presidential Documents"
    },
